  "description": "Bindery HTTP traffic, background jobs, downloads, imports, indexer searches and process health. Metrics verified against Bindery internal/metrics/metrics.go and operational.go, the queue collector in cmd/bindery/queue_metrics.go and docs/metrics.md (bindery_http_*, bindery_scheduler_*, bindery_grabs_total, bindery_download_client_*, bindery_imports_total, bindery_indexer_*, bindery_queue_items, bindery_build_info) plus the client_golang go_/process_ collectors it registers; the project publishes no dashboard. Bindery's own job label reaches Prometheus as exported_job, because the scrape config sets no honor_labels.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
